1
00:00:00,580 --> 00:00:02,200
(Sheldon:)in our living room,

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:05,570
(Sheldon:)and night after night of
uninformative TV documentaries

3
00:00:05,570 --> 00:00:08,120
(Sheldon:)about the Jersey Shore.

4
00:00:09,630 --> 00:00:12,430
(Leonard:)Suffered in silence?

5
00:00:12,430 --> 00:00:14,430
(Sheldon:)Yes.

6
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:18,720
(Sheldon:)And I'd thank you to do the same.

7
00:00:20,550 --> 00:00:22,640
Reall-- Silence?!

8
00:00:25,810 --> 00:00:27,430
(sighs): Ah.

9
00:00:27,430 --> 00:00:29,230
(Raj:)Nothing makes beer
taste better than

10
00:00:29,230 --> 00:00:33,220
(Raj:)cool clear Rocky
Mountain spring water.

11
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:35,340
(Raj:)Where are the Rocky
Mountains, anyway?

12
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:39,010
(Howard:)Philadelphia.

13
00:00:39,010 --> 00:00:40,020
(Amy:)Really?

14
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:41,460
(Raj:)I thought they were
out West someplace.

15
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:42,610
(Howard:)Think about it, Raj.

16
00:00:42,610 --> 00:00:45,980
Where did the movie
Rocky take place?

17
00:00:45,980 --> 00:00:48,550
(Howard:)Philadelphia.

18
00:00:48,550 --> 00:00:50,500
(Raj:)Okay, now I get it.

19
00:00:51,890 --> 00:00:53,090
(Penny:)So this is the plan?

20
00:00:53,090 --> 00:00:55,050
(Penny:)From now on, we're just
gonna hide out in here

21
00:00:55,060 --> 00:00:57,220
(Penny:)to avoid the Shamy?

22
00:00:57,220 --> 00:00:58,810
(Raj:)I'm very comfortable here.

23
00:00:58,810 --> 00:01:03,350
(Raj:)Penny, dear, why don't you shoot
another silver bullet my way?

